# "Your opponents" (CR 102.2, 611.2c): in a three-player game, Avatar's Wrath bars each of Bot1's opponents as it resolves
# in turn 1, until Bot1's next turn, turn 4. Bot2 (turn 2) and Bot3 (turn 3) each cast Faithless Looting from the hand and,
# with Black Lotus there to pay for it, are refused its flashback. After Bot1's turn 4 each flashes it back on its own
# next turn (5 and 6): the controls.

